RECORDED RESULT: Nsight Compute is unavailable to us. It needs profiling
permission, which this node denies when RmProfilingAdminOnly=1, and it
serialises kernels so it could not share a run with the energy pass
regardless. Its absence is a finding about the deployment, not a gap in
the method.

